1. TCGA LUAD Expression Dataset

File name:
TCGA.LUAD.sampleMap_HiSeqV2

Source:
UCSC Xena Browser (TCGA project)

Dataset origin:
The Cancer Genome Atlas (TCGA)

Cancer type:
Lung Adenocarcinoma (LUAD)

File format:
Tab-separated values (TSV)

Description:
This file contains RNA-seq gene expression data generated using the Illumina HiSeq platform for LUAD patient samples.

Data structure:

Rows represent individual genes

Columns represent patient samples

Values represent log2-normalized gene expression levels

Sample information:
Each sample column contains a TCGA barcode, where:

01 indicates primary tumor tissue

11 indicates normal lung tissue

Purpose in Task 3:
This file was used to compare EGFR expression between tumor and normal LUAD samples.

2. DepMap CRISPR Gene Dependency Dataset

File name:
CRISPRGeneEffect.csv

Source:
Cancer Dependency Map (DepMap) Portal

Dataset type:
Genome-wide CRISPR–Cas9 knockout screening data

File format:
Comma-separated values (CSV)

Description:
This dataset contains gene effect scores that quantify the impact of gene knockout on cancer cell survival.

Data structure:

Rows represent cancer cell lines

Columns represent genes

Values represent gene-effect dependency scores

Score interpretation:

More negative values indicate stronger dependency

Scores near zero indicate non-essential genes

Purpose in Task 3:
This file was used to evaluate whether LUAD cell lines depend on EGFR for survival.

3. DepMap Cell Line Annotation File

File name:
Model.csv

Source:
DepMap Portal

File format:
CSV

Description:
This file provides metadata information for each cancer cell line.

Key information included:

DepMap cell line ID

Cancer type classification

Oncotree cancer code

Tissue of origin

Purpose in Task 3:
This file was used to identify and filter Lung Adenocarcinoma (LUAD) cell lines from the CRISPR dependency dataset.
